- Document clienthttp[,svc,only] tags in hosts.cfg

* Mon Nov 23 2015 Japheth Cleaver <cleaver@terabithia.org> 4.3.24-1
- Release 4.3.24 (fixes HTTP status code mis-processing)
- liblzo should be liblzo2 on most modern systems.

* Thu Nov 12 2015 Japheth Cleaver <cleaver@terabithia.org> 4.3.23-1
